lishing the complete committed bank; never substitute current configuration. Schema4 keeps six references and section7 final status, adds radio-layout schema byte at offset66 before unchanged profile bytes. Section6 appends active_present:u8; zero ends the object, one adds saved_generation:u32, record_crc32:u32 and complete228B SSIC kind3. Snapshot commit rejects unsaved/stale active data; no current coefficients substituted.","ssms_radio":"SSMS section0 offset66: schema2 legacy SX128x PHY15; schema3 typed backend:u8/version:u8/length:u16. backend1/version1 is historical NRF14. backend2/version1 is SX1278 body16 with module1 E32-400M20S only; 433MHz/SF7/BW125/4-5/preamble16/MTU61/+17dBm. No hardware qualification inferred. Schema4 offset66 selects legacy radio layout2 or3; profile begins at67. All historical profiles retain original meanings.","ssob":"CRC32 IEEE over bytes [0,14) followed by payload [18,end); generation nonzero; two slots; payload 1..512; kind 1..6; kind6 stores active SSIC packet at system/install/active00.0/.1; instance <32"},"schema_id":"silverstar.object-catalog/1.0"}
